
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Althenian Beliefs on Twins.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Althenian Beliefs on Twins.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"5x3hjd","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777149405417,"size":2036,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"5x3hjd"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,19],"#Culture - Althenian Beliefs on Twins":[21,29],"#Culture - Althenian Beliefs on Twins#{1}":[23,29]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["twins","twin","identical","fraternal","soul","iris"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Althenian Beliefs on Twins**  \n*Selection trigger: Story involves characters who are twins, or discussion of twins within the Althenian cultural context.*  \n\n**Core Belief:** Twins are considered a sign of Althena’s divine will, though not official church doctrine.  \n\n- **Identical twins:** Believed to be a single soul split into two bodies by Althena for an unknown ordained purpose. Folk belief: they can feel each other's sensations regardless of distance.  \n- **Fraternal twins:** Seen as divinely connected spiritually and biologically, with a mystical bond that may allow shared feelings/sensations.  \n\n**Key Relationships:**  \n- In Duran, this belief is referenced regarding Prince {{user}} and Princess Iris (fraternal twins), even by non-believers in Althena.  \n- Contrast with official church doctrine (not defined here)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Althenian Beliefs on Twins.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1wh9dq","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Althenian Beliefs on Twins.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,19],"size":1033,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
